    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d405">

                <pb facs="0392" n="378" xml:id="pg378"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.34522/45: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-10-02T12:00:00-05:00">October 2,
                            1942—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 3:51 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>808. Reference my telegram 797, September 28, 4 p.m.<anchor n="32"
                        xml:id="d405-f1"/> The Minister of National Defense informed Colonel
                    Montesinos that the President desired to conclude an agreement on the Galápagos
                    within the next few days and before he makes his visit to the United States.
                    Colonel Montesinos has with him a copy of agreement submitted by General Andrews
                    for approval. Request instructions by cable.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Panama for the information of General Andrews.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
